want to use GPUs,

00:24:37.590 --> 00:24:39.150
we need to install the drivers.

00:24:39.150 --> 00:24:42.300
And we need to set
up a stack driver

00:24:42.300 --> 00:24:46.680
service that is going to be
monitoring the GPU utilization.

00:24:46.680 --> 00:24:49.260
In this case, we're going
