00:32:42.620 --> 00:32:44.020
And we never configured this.

00:32:44.020 --> 00:32:46.600
So it was just-- or I believe
we had set this to 0 minutes.

00:32:46.600 --> 00:32:49.010
And then the jobs
were just failing.

00:32:49.010 --> 00:32:51.880
So we added this, and of
course, that perfectly

00:32:51.880 --> 00:32:53.380
solved our problem.

00:32:53.380 --> 00:32:54.310
So that's autoscaling.

